Source: Federal Reserve Economic Data (FRED), which aggregates official US data.
Date Pulled: October 2026.
Method: We used direct CSV downloads.
Licence/Privacy: It is public domain US government data, so there are no privacy concerns.
If a stranger wants to repull this data next month they just need to go to the FRED links for CPILFESL, WTISPLC, PPIACO, and M2V and hit download. The pipeline won't break, but the new files will just have one extra row for the new month, changing our total row count from 480 to 481.
